Leanne: [wait=0.6]That's the problem, David.

if GameState.has_flag("door_unlocked_bathroom")
	David: You've been in the bathroom again. You can't keep going in there.
else
	David: Just leave it on the floor.

do GameState.set_flag("heard_portrait_argument")
do GameState.restore_memory()

